    "body": "<del>It seems like this implements (1) from https://github.com/tc39/proposal-import-attributes/issues/144, right? Can you give a bit more detail on the reasoning process there, and in particular how this impacts static vs. dynamic imports?</del>\r\n\r\n<ins>Hmm no, I guess this is more like (1), but then adding an extra check to skip unnecessary work?</ins>\r\n\r\nAre there tests you've written that show the choice of (1) vs. (2)?",
