    "updated_at": "2023-08-23T10:18:50Z",
    "body": "I pushed a new test to https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/41581. The first two tests in each file verify the order in which the import declaration checks happen, while the third one verifies that the \"unknown attributes check\" is present. Before this PR, this code:\r\n```js\r\nimport \"./valid\" with { unknown: \"foo\" };\r\nimport \"INVALID\";\r\n```\r\nwould throw about the `\"INVALID\"` specifier before validating the `unknown` attribute.",
